  "title": "Bringing Safe Drinking Water to Rural Colombia",
  "summary": "In remote villages of Putumayo, Colombia, where government support is limited, access to clean water remains a persistent challenge, exposing families to waterborne diseases and other health risks. To help close this gap, GTE has led the Water for Communities (Agua de Mi Tierra) initiative, which began in 2024. Through the Agua de Mi Tierra […]",
